1
00:00:02,687 --> 00:00:04,207
I'm Peppa Pig

2
00:00:04,807 --> 00:00:06,953
And this is my little brother, George

3
00:00:07,487 --> 00:00:09,407
This is Mummy Pig

4
00:00:09,767 --> 00:00:11,167
And this is Daddy Pig

5
00:00:13,526 --> 00:00:15,028
Peppa Pig!

6
00:00:17,366 --> 00:00:19,518
"Recycling"

7
00:00:20,666 --> 00:00:23,509
Mr Bull the dustman is collecting the rubbish

8
00:00:24,190 --> 00:00:25,712
It is still very early

9
00:00:25,752 --> 00:00:27,480
So when Mr Bull empties the rubbish...

10
00:00:27,521 --> 00:00:29,434
he tries to be as quiet as possible

11
00:00:32,361 --> 00:00:34,539
But Mr Bull isn't very good

12
00:00:34,580 --> 00:00:36,022
at being quiet

13
00:00:37,568 --> 00:00:39,855
Peppa and George have finished their breakfast

14
00:00:40,571 --> 00:00:42,374
What's that noise?

15
00:00:42,414 --> 00:00:44,776
It's Mr Bull emptying the rubbish

16
00:00:46,400 --> 00:00:48,299
Hello, Mr Bull!

17
00:00:49,461 --> 00:00:50,942
Hello, everyone!

18
00:00:51,023 --> 00:00:52,223
I have to go now

19
00:00:52,505 --> 00:00:53,976
I have lots more rubbish to empty

20
00:00:54,016 --> 00:00:56,076
-Bye-bye!
-Bye-bye!

21
00:00:59,809 --> 00:01:02,837
Mr Bull has emptied our rubbish

22
00:01:03,438 --> 00:01:06,358
Very good, let's clear the table now breakfast is finished

23
00:01:06,398 --> 00:01:08,038
Can we help?

24
00:01:08,078 --> 00:01:09,658
Yes, you can help

25
00:01:09,699 --> 00:01:12,479
I'll throw this empty bottle into the rubbish bin

26
00:01:12,519 --> 00:01:13,899
Peppa, stop!

27
00:01:13,939 --> 00:01:14,877
What is it?

28
00:01:14,917 --> 00:01:17,437
We don't throw bottles in the rubbish bin

29
00:01:17,477 --> 00:01:19,236
Because they can be recycled

30
00:01:19,276 --> 00:01:20,916
What does recycling mean?

31
00:01:20,956 --> 00:01:23,276
All the things we can't use again...

32
00:01:23,316 --> 00:01:26,195
we put in the rubbish bin for Mr Bull to collect

33
00:01:26,676 --> 00:01:29,239
But all the things we can use again...

34
00:01:29,279 --> 00:01:31,793
go into these recycling boxes

35
00:01:31,873 --> 00:01:34,444
The red one is for newspapers

36
00:01:34,565 --> 00:01:36,767
The blue one is for tin cans

37
00:01:36,807 --> 00:01:39,507
And the green one is for bottles

38
00:01:40,131 --> 00:01:42,331
Peppa, you have an empty bottle

39
00:01:42,371 --> 00:01:44,571
So which box should it go in?

40
00:01:45,251 --> 00:01:46,610
The green box!

41
00:01:47,243 --> 00:01:48,243
That's right!

42
00:01:49,010 --> 00:01:50,346
This is fun!

43
00:01:50,386 --> 00:01:52,465
Now it's George's turn

44
00:01:52,770 --> 00:01:55,570
Go find a newspaper to put in the red box

45
00:01:58,869 --> 00:02:01,509
George wants to recycle Daddy Pig's newspaper

46
00:02:03,130 --> 00:02:04,531
I'm really sorry, George

47
00:02:04,571 --> 00:02:06,572
I haven't finished reading the newspaper yet

48
00:02:06,773 --> 00:02:08,534
I'll give it to you in a bit

49
00:02:10,816 --> 00:02:12,257
Oh, all right then

50
00:02:12,297 --> 00:02:13,778
Here you go, George

51
00:02:16,100 --> 00:02:18,942
The newspaper goes in the red box, George

52
00:02:21,915 --> 00:02:24,187
Now we've collected enough things

53
00:02:24,227 --> 00:02:26,545
We can go to the recycling centre!

54
00:02:26,585 --> 00:02:28,972
Hurray, let's go!

55
00:02:30,592 --> 00:02:32,032
Mummy Pig carries the bottles

56
00:02:33,273 --> 00:02:34,593
Peppa carries the tin cans

57
00:02:35,793 --> 00:02:37,554
And George carries the newspapers

58
00:02:40,234 --> 00:02:41,754
Is everyone ready?

59
00:02:41,794 --> 00:02:43,195
Yes, Daddy!

60
00:02:43,595 --> 00:02:45,452
Off we go then!

61
00:02:49,620 --> 00:02:52,596
Recycle, recycle
we're going to recycle

62
00:02:52,637 --> 00:02:54,594
Tin cans

63
00:02:55,147 --> 00:02:56,548
Bottles

64
00:02:57,262 --> 00:02:59,382
Newspapers

65
00:03:01,489 --> 00:03:04,465
Recycle, recycle
we're going to recycle

66
00:03:09,168 --> 00:03:11,810
This is Miss Rabbit's recycling centre

67
00:03:11,850 --> 00:03:12,691
Here we are!

68
00:03:12,731 --> 00:03:13,851
Hooray!

69
00:03:13,892 --> 00:03:15,235
Hello, everyone

70
00:03:15,454 --> 00:03:17,173
Hello, Miss Rabbit

71
00:03:17,247 --> 00:03:19,697
Have you got any rubbish to recycle?

72
00:03:19,737 --> 00:03:20,979
Yes, that's right

73
00:03:21,019 --> 00:03:22,339
Very good

74
00:03:23,380 --> 00:03:24,420
Here we go

75
00:03:24,741 --> 00:03:26,941
What is Miss Rabbit doing?

76
00:03:27,501 --> 00:03:30,702
She's recycling rusty old cars

77
00:03:35,423 --> 00:03:38,063
Which box do the glass bottles go in?

78
00:03:38,343 --> 00:03:39,943
The green box

79
00:03:40,024 --> 00:03:40,984
That's right

80
00:03:43,014 --> 00:03:45,574
And the tin cans go in the blue box

81
00:03:45,614 --> 00:03:47,374
Clever Peppa!

82
00:03:49,055 --> 00:03:51,655
George wants to recycle the newspapers

83
00:03:52,136 --> 00:03:53,357
All right, George

84
00:03:53,463 --> 00:03:55,722
Put the newspapers in the recycling box

85
00:03:59,398 --> 00:04:00,359
All done

86
00:04:00,600 --> 00:04:02,883
That's all our recycling done for today

87
00:04:02,923 --> 00:04:03,925
That's right

88
00:04:04,045 --> 00:04:05,314
Let's go home

89
00:04:06,699 --> 00:04:09,430
Oh, where has our car gone?

90
00:04:09,532 --> 00:04:11,254
Peppa's car has gone

91
00:04:11,294 --> 00:04:12,655
Stand back!

92
00:04:13,097 --> 00:04:16,156
Miss Rabbit is going to recycle Peppa's car!

93
00:04:16,650 --> 00:04:19,356
Stop! That's our car!

94
00:04:19,521 --> 00:04:21,397
What? Really?

95
00:04:21,437 --> 00:04:22,517
Yes!

96
00:04:22,558 --> 00:04:25,783
Our car isn't old, and it isn't rusty!

97
00:04:28,041 --> 00:04:29,082
Silly me!

98
00:04:29,122 --> 00:04:31,265
I just love recycling rubbish so much

99
00:04:31,305 --> 00:04:33,417
Yes, so do we

100
00:04:33,725 --> 00:04:36,326
But we still really love our car

101
00:04:36,526 --> 00:04:39,728
Yes, and our car loves us too

102
00:04:39,768 --> 00:04:40,816
Doesn't it?
